cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these formalizations, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "llm-audit-lean: Lean formalizations from a self-audit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Aronow"
    given-names: "P. M."
date-released: "2026-11-08"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pmaronow/llm-audit-lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalizations accompanying a self-audit of 50 works by P. M. Aronow and coauthors.
  The current package records 1021 targets: 805 whole, 110 restricted, 73 refuted and 33 omitted,
  with 988 proved formal statements and explicit assumptions and restrictions. Developed with AI agents,
  including adapted third-party code attributed in NOTICE. Formal proof and fidelity to a paper claim
  are distinct; use the per-work guides for exact statements, proofs and scope.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - statistics
  - causal inference
  - probability
  - randomization inference
  - survey sampling
